	(text "Top pins: USB_OTP_VDD, ADC_AVDD, QSPI_IOVDD, IOVDD (x8) and\nVREG_VIN share +3V3; VREG_FB and DVDD (x3) are the 1.1 V core\nrail (DVDD_1V1), made by the on-chip regulator. Each supply\npin gets its own 100 nF (Decoupling box)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 167.64 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e784b54e-5ea7-550b-aa8a-af17cf7365ba"))
